# Mercedes-Benz S-Class W220 saloon, 1998-2005.
#
# The rounded S-Class that replaced the W140: launched at Paris in September 1998,
# 5,038 mm long on the 2,965 mm wheelbase (LWB 5,158/3,085), 1,857 mm wide,
# 1,444 mm high; 2.8-5.0 petrol and diesels, S55 AMG, S600 V12. Facelift 2002.
# https://mercedes-benz-publicarchive.com/marsClassic/en/instance/ko/220-series-S-Class-Saloons-1998---2002.xhtml?oid=453360
# https://www.mercedesman.ru/en/S-Class/W220/main/manual/specifikacii-i-razmery-avtomobilya
#
# Colours: black, brilliant silver, nautical blue and smoke silver, the same
# period Mercedes palette as the W140.
#
# Weight: 15 in total (black 5, silver 4, blue 3, grey 3), below the W140's 20 as
# the measured UK parc of the later generation is smaller.
#
# Speed 210 km/h; comfort 180/450 (line).
# Dates: 1998-2005 with a road tail to about 2016.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/mercedes-w220.blend. References:
# citycars/references/mercedes-w220/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

obj=citycar
